    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PRJ001 - Tool - Reschedule Appointment\n\n**Purpose:** Reschedules an existing customer appointment.\n\n**Inputs:** `session_id`, `event_id`, `date_time`\n\n**Process:**\n1. Authenticate customer and verify appointment ownership.\n2. Retrieve and validate the existing appointment.\n3. Book the new appointment.\n4. Cancel the original appointment after successful booking.\n5. Roll back the new booking if cancellation fails.\n\n**Error Handling:** Handles authentication, validation, booking, cancellation, and rollback errors.\n\n**Dependencies:** Redis, Google Calendar, Book Appointment, Cancel User Appointment.",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 736,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -656,
        -240
